@organization
title: Reorganize the party
subtitle: Tighten the party's organization. · dev: kf_centre_strength +3
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4; kf_centre_strength += 3

Pieck reorganizes the districts. The party works better, and the Centre, who run the machine, gain a little more control over it.

@finances
title: Put the finances in order
subtitle: Collect arrears and cut waste. · dev: resources +1, kf_centre_strength +1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 4; resources += 1; kf_centre_strength += 1

Pieck gets the accounts in order and the arrears collected. In an inflation this is harder than it sounds.
